{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/原初•超凡之躯","pageid":6586,"revid":14945,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9D%E2%80%A2%E8%B6%85%E5%87%A1%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AF&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9D%E2%80%A2%E8%B6%85%E5%87%A1%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AF&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9D%E2%80%A2%E8%B6%85%E5%87%A1%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AF&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>原初•超凡之躯</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8E.9F.E5.88.9D.E2.80.A2.E8.B6.85.E5.87.A1.E4.B9.8B.E8.BA.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"原初•超凡之躯\"><b>原初•超凡之躯</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 原初•超凡之躯.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/19/it95wguej0q384oblph18cdk3dt3gl8.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9D%E2%80%A2%E8%B6%85%E5%87%A1%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/19/it95wguej0q384oblph18cdk3dt3gl8.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9D%E2%80%A2%E8%B6%85%E5%87%A1%E4%B9%8B%E8%BA%AF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/19/it95wguej0q384oblph18cdk3dt3gl8.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />原初•超凡之躯\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center> <br /><br /><b>&#160;技能冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"原初之力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">原初之力</font></span></span>]期间被击败时，消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"人造原初烙痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">人造原初烙痕</font></span></span>]点数并触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强力不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强力不屈</font></span></span>]；若点数不足或战斗中再次触发，则退出[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"原初之力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">原初之力</font></span></span>]并受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"遗忘症\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">遗忘症</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。<br />✦退出[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"原初之力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">原初之力</font></span></span>]时重置此技能中[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强力不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强力不屈</font></span></span>]触发计数。<br />✦被非克制自身的敌人攻击时，伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B2%99%E5%A8%9C%E5%A7%BF\" title=\"角色图鉴库/沙娜姿\"><img alt=\"头像 沙娜姿.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/dfiln7jjrprd5idshjt5ru2xklupq6i.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">沙娜姿</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164118\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.448 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.576 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9878/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 161304/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18237/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nU